---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Dental health tips and news from Smile Dental Clinic in Ahmedabad.
permalink: /blog/
---

<section>
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Our Blog</div>
    <h2>Dental health tips and insights</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Advice and updates from our dental team.</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="services-grid">
    {% for post in collections.blog %}
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-card-content">
        <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">Read more →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p>No posts yet. Check back soon.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
